{"version": 1, "slug": "tistory-77", "visibility": "public", "title": "[DreamHack] - half image", "content": "<div class=\"tistory-content\">\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/a2aad9c4bdc4bec6e56944c08f54578a059bed92607109c5aa7031f29a831928.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>드림핵 half image 문제 설명</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- 파일을 다운로드 받은 후 압축 풀기</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/cef41d8a636c8b5575af184412dc714a8956b892a3753874ba48505c503ccbce.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- flag.png 확인</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/16ab253a65fcfaf3e48e348ea2e3612cccfaac8379fd3fe7864f091200ace715.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption>flag.png</figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- flag.py 확인</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/3f2da46d103bbf81779ea9defef13040cf69dda8f5fa677d0bce3c0a400f68f5.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>-&gt; 왼쪽 절반은 완전한 PNG 파일, 그 뒤에 오른쪽 절반이 압축 안 된 생 픽셀 데이터로 그냥 이어붙여져 있음</p>\n<p>-&gt; 뷰어는 IEND 청크를 만나면 거기서 파싱을 멈추니까 왼쪽 절반만 보이는 것</p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- solve.py 파이썬 코드 작성</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/734ce9b8a2668e95d3cae61dff56b221b1fa95ddc37e7e8a986591a60ed6865b.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<ol>\n<li>IEND 청크 끝(= IEND 위치 + 8바이트, 타입 4 + CRC 4) 기준으로 파일을 자름</li>\n<li>앞부분 → 그냥 PNG로 열면 왼쪽 절반. 여기서 hw(왼쪽 폭)와 height를 얻음</li>\n<li>뒷부분 → len(rdata) // (3 * height) 로 오른쪽 폭 계산 (RGB니까 픽셀당 3바이트)</li>\n<li>Image.frombytes로 복원해서 좌우 이어붙이기</li>\n</ol>\n<p>- solve.py 코드 실행</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/191b3847c9e86507b77c7928201fc8838a5af41167c137a5700321c48fd37608.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- 생성된 사진</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/d318b03ad3c9f40030e1f3889ca59d39d83c148b3b5210be157be0e206dcd891.png\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- 사진 열어보기</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/fa7ce2869a319b4aa24953359ba8d6c4d2475ebab2a816702b94d10ca0635516.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>- 풀이 완료</p>\n<p><figure class=\"imageblock alignCenter\">\n<span>\n<img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./content/media/de7319f65e84864ce18cd5d22ea160f4cdb77ec588cf928d182d54ef00f43207.jpg\"/>\n</span>\n<figcaption></figcaption>\n</figure></p>\n</div>", "assets": ["16ab253a65fcfaf3e48e348ea2e3612cccfaac8379fd3fe7864f091200ace715.png", "191b3847c9e86507b77c7928201fc8838a5af41167c137a5700321c48fd37608.png", "3f2da46d103bbf81779ea9defef13040cf69dda8f5fa677d0bce3c0a400f68f5.png", "734ce9b8a2668e95d3cae61dff56b221b1fa95ddc37e7e8a986591a60ed6865b.png", "a2aad9c4bdc4bec6e56944c08f54578a059bed92607109c5aa7031f29a831928.png", "cef41d8a636c8b5575af184412dc714a8956b892a3753874ba48505c503ccbce.png", "d318b03ad3c9f40030e1f3889ca59d39d83c148b3b5210be157be0e206dcd891.png", "de7319f65e84864ce18cd5d22ea160f4cdb77ec588cf928d182d54ef00f43207.jpg", "fa7ce2869a319b4aa24953359ba8d6c4d2475ebab2a816702b94d10ca0635516.jpg"]}